    },
    "consequence": "Preserve token ownership and fallback semantics in any future authoring correction. Do not replace them with captured literal pixels or compensate through child offsets, width or font adjustments.",
    "limits": [
      "Synthetic token values isolate missing-token fallback, component override, invalid-token inheritance and descendant overrides; they do not establish the actual theme token origin.",
